%N A399651 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} H(k)/(k*(k+1))^2, where H(k) = A001008(k)/A002805(k) is the k-th harmonic number.
%H A399651 Ross C. McPhedran and David H. Bailey, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.06294">New Results for Euler Sums</a>, arXiv:2311.06294 [math.NT], 2023-2026. See p. 24, eq. (131).
%H A399651 Michael I. Shamos, <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20220206102634/https://citeseerx.ist.psu.edu/viewdoc/download?doi=10.1.1.366.9997&amp;rep=rep1&amp;type=pdf">A catalog of the real numbers</a>, 2011. See pp. 130, 219, and 367.
%H A399651 <a href="/index/Ha#harmonic">Index entries for sequences related to harmonic numbers</a>.
%H A399651 <a href="/index/Z#zeta_function">Index entries for zeta function</a>.
%F A399651 Equals 3*zeta(3) - 2*zeta(2).
%F A399651 Formulas from Shamos (2011): (Start)
%F A399651 Equals 2 * Integral_{x=0..1} x * log(x)^2/(1+x)^2 dx.
%F A399651 Equals 2 * Integral_{x>=1} log(x)^2/(x*(1+x)^2) dx.
%F A399651 Equals 4 * Sum_{k>=1} (-1)^(k+1) * k / (k+1)^3. (End)
%e A399651 0.316302575782329983254384151242299593857059074607899...
